      "settings": {
        "content_bg_color": "#ffffff",
        "heading": "Customer Service That’ll Floor You",
        "sub_heading": "",
        "content": "<p> It’s not just our floors that are spotless—there’s also our reputation for sincere and sustainable business practices that always put the client first.</p>"
      }
    },
    "be2c139b-819c-414e-9bed-c907fc9f4316": {
      "type": "elevated-image-content",
      "settings": {
        "bg_color": "#e0f3ed",
        "text_color": "#111111",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/trade_reward_cta.png",
        "contain_image": true,
        "heading": "Benefits",
        "sub_heading": "",
        "content": "<p><strong>Color Your Guests Impressed</strong></p><p>Perk up any space and express your unique style with flooring that flaunts one of our dazzling, designer-curated colors. With our variety of options, you’re sure to find the look you’ve been dreaming of.</p><p><strong>Only the Highest Quality to Hold You Up</strong></p><p>You + your floors may be one of the longest relationships of your life. That’s why we use only the highest quality materials to design floors that will support you through thick and thin.</p><p><strong>The Eco-Conscious Choice</strong></p><p>Bring the beauty of nature into your home without harming the Earth. With our commitment to transparent business practices and the use of sustainably-sourced materials, you can ensure a space that supports your lifestyle while also supporting the planet.</p>",
        "link_text": "",
        "link_url": ""
      }
    },
